# OpenAPI spec is generated, not committed. Emitted by `pnpm gen:openapi`
# and on API boot. Read by gen-catalog + the @openora/mcp query-openapi
# tool, which regenerate/expect it locally (pnpm setup runs regen).
docs/openapi.json
apps/*/docs/openapi.json
.cache
